1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,375
Pause: an optional chapter on
personalised learning.

2
00:00:04,825 --> 00:00:05,930
In the optional learning path,

3
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:08,123
the user chooses to learn something
instead of scrolling.

4
00:00:08,173 --> 00:00:11,126
Pause already knows a little about them,
because they told it: a trip to Rome,

5
00:00:11,176 --> 00:00:12,858
an interest in history, and business studies.

6
00:00:13,308 --> 00:00:18,699
Pause shows one short card, chosen because
the user is planning to visit Rome.

7
00:00:18,749 --> 00:00:22,186
It has an image, a short
explanation and a source.

8
00:00:22,236 --> 00:00:25,186
The content is curated, not generated live.

9
00:00:25,636 --> 00:00:31,004
A quick question and thumbs-up feedback
are available but optional.

10
00:00:31,054 --> 00:00:36,907
When the user taps Done for now, they
return straight to the home screen.

11
00:00:36,957 --> 00:00:39,737
No completion screen, no next card.

12
00:00:40,187 --> 00:00:41,842
One detour, then done.

13
00:00:41,892 --> 00:00:47,268
Learning stays optional, personalised
from what users choose to share,

14
00:00:47,318 --> 00:00:49,206
and ends cleanly at home.
